    "GOA must remain plural across invariant, recurrent, occupation, QSD and certificate-dependent unique/mixing structures.",
    "Scale mathematics is machine-checked; Wilsonian RG remains an explicit missing bridge, not a synonym.",
    "Evolution theory exists at population/operator level; object-level lineage and reproduction remain a later bridge."
